## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Gold Lane Crit Default (Gold)

- Items: Swift Boots, Windtalker, Berserker's Fury, Haas's Claws, Malefic Gun, Wind of Nature
- Core: Windtalker, Berserker's Fury, Haas's Claws
- Emblem: Marksman Emblem with Fatal, Weapon Master, Quantum Charge
- Battle spell: Inspire
- Flex: Malefic Roar over Malefic Gun when Use when tanks and fighters are stacking Physical Defense and you can already fight from a protected angle.; Rose Gold Meteor over Wind of Nature when Use against magic burst or mixed dive where physical immunity will not stop the first engage.; Sea Halberd over Malefic Gun when Use when sustain, shields, or high-extra-HP front liners are keeping Miya's first target alive.
- Total cost: 11030 gold

Default ranked crit setup that turns Miya's Moon Arrow window into a fast three-item damage spike, then adds range or survivability based on who can reach her.

### Front-to-Back On-Hit (Gold)

- Items: Swift Boots, Corrosion Scythe, Demon Hunter Sword, Golden Staff, Malefic Roar, Sea Halberd
- Core: Corrosion Scythe, Demon Hunter Sword, Golden Staff
- Emblem: Marksman Emblem with Swift, Weapon Master, Weakness Finder
- Battle spell: Inspire
- Flex: Wind of Nature over Sea Halberd when Use if a physical diver or enemy marksman decides fights before Miya can finish the frontline.; Rose Gold Meteor over Sea Halberd when Use when the main threat is magic burst and the team still needs Miya to keep hitting the nearest target.
- Total cost: 11050 gold

Anti-frontline setup for games where Miya must keep firing through durable targets and repeatedly trigger attack effects with Moon Arrow.

### Safe Late Game (Gold)

- Items: Tough Boots, Windtalker, Berserker's Fury, Haas's Claws, Rose Gold Meteor, Immortality
- Core: Windtalker, Berserker's Fury, Haas's Claws
- Emblem: Marksman Emblem with Fatal, Weapon Master, Quantum Charge
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Wind of Nature over Rose Gold Meteor when Use against physical burst if the main threat is a basic-attack assassin, fighter, or enemy marksman.; Malefic Gun over Immortality when Use when the enemy lacks reliable backline access and Miya needs range to finish fights without stepping forward.; Athena's Shield over Immortality when Use against one-shot magic engage that kills Miya before Immortality can create a playable second life.
- Total cost: 10930 gold

Defensive late-game setup for CC-heavy or burst-heavy drafts where Miya must survive the first engage before using Hidden Moonlight to re-enter.

